  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZacPro 6.2 cont</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ZacPro 6.2 cont.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbetsprojekt kring Zambezifloden. Huvudsyfte: kommunikationskomponenter f&#xf6;r stakeholders, en integrerad vattenresursstrategi, datoriserat vatteninformationsystem, facilitera ratificeringen av ZAMCOM avtalet. Projektavslut: 30 Juni 2009. Samfinansierat av Sverige, Danmark och Norge. Sverige har varit lead donor hela tiden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transboundary river basin cooperation in the Zambezi river basin. Priary goal: stakeholder communication and forum, development of an integrated water resources development strategy, computerised water information system, and to facilitate the ratification of the ZAMCOM agreement. Project completion: June 2009. Co-funded with Denmark and Norway. Sweden lead donor.</narrative>
  </description>
